+/*
+ * mdadm --kill-subarray: the volume is stopped (Kill_subarray checks).  As
+ * IMSM, not when a later volume runs: it would be renumbered under md.  A
+ * Legacy LD (a disk with data) is no subarray (amd_parse_packet).
